What is the output of the following Java program utilizing a custom unchecked exception?
```java
class AccountBlockedException extends RuntimeException {
    public AccountBlockedException(String reason) {
        super(reason);
    }
}
public class AccountService {
    public static void verify(boolean active) {
        if (!active) throw new AccountBlockedException("Suspended");
        System.out.print("Active ");
    }
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        try {
            verify(false);
        } catch (AccountBlockedException ex) {
            System.out.print(ex.getMessage());
        }
    }
}
```

